msgid "Step 1."
msgstr "Steg 1."

msgid "Do you have any column which can be split into more than one column? For example: address can be split into street, city, country and zip."
msgstr "Har du någon kolumn som kan delas upp i mer än en kolumn? Till exempel: adress kan delas in i gata, stad, land och postnummer."

